  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Here, the units of &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to unit of electric field.</p><p>The unit of electric field is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>So, the SI unit of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>And&nbsp;the SI unit of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
